msgctxt "seo_title"
msgid "Privacy Not Included"
msgstr "Confidentialité non incluse"

msgctxt "search_description"
msgid ""
"Privacy Not Included was launched in 2017 to help you understand the privacy risks of tech products that connect to the internet. We are continuing that work in the form of Privacy Reviews at our "
"magazine Nothing Personal, where our privacy experts do hours of hands-on testing and research on the most popular consumer tech items and their privacy features."
msgstr ""
"Confidentialité non incluse a été lancé en 2017 afin de vous aider à comprendre les risques liés à la confidentialité des produits technologiques connectés à Internet. Nous poursuivons ce travail "
"sous la forme d’évaluations de protection de la confidentialité dans notre magazine Nothing Personal, où nos experts en la matière consacrent des heures à des essais pratiques et à des recherches "
"sur les produits technologiques grand public les plus populaires et leurs fonctionnalités liées à la confidentialité."

msgctxt "title"
msgid "Privacy Not Included"
msgstr "Confidentialité non incluse"

msgctxt "hero_title"
msgid "*Privacy Not Included has shifted"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.7e64b2f0-2bd6-4f93-8e02-bd1d704a967a"
msgid "<b>Privacy Not Included</b> was launched in 2017 to help everyone understand the privacy risks associated with tech products that connect to the internet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.7e64b2f0-2bd6-4f93-8e02-bd1d704a967a"
msgid ""
"We are continuing that work in the form of <b>Product Reviews</b> at our magazine <a id=\"a1\"><b>Nothing Personal</b></a>, where our privacy experts do hours of <a id=\"a2\">hands-on testing and "
"research</a> on the most popular consumer tech items and their privacy features."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.7e64b2f0-2bd6-4f93-8e02-bd1d704a967a"
msgid "To access the <a id=\"a1\">Privacy Not Included archive</a>, please visit the <a id=\"a2\">Internet Wayback Machine</a>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.7e64b2f0-2bd6-4f93-8e02-bd1d704a967a"
msgid ""
"Interested in how the privacy policies of specific products have changed over time? Visit our partners at <a id=\"a1\">Harvard’s Transparency Hub</a>, where you can search, compare, and better "
"understand the data practices of social platforms and technology apps."
msgstr ""
